      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Same issue here on iPhone. Every video URL fails to load in any world: after submitting a URL the player shows the loading spinner for about one second, then stops without any error (\"No media loaded\"). Tested with full and short YouTube links (www.youtube.com/watch?v=...), with \"Allow Untrusted URLs\" enabled, after restarting VRChat, and in multiple worlds (The Viewing Room with ProTV, and my own world Club La Familia). The same links work fine on PC and Quest. Possibly related to \"iOS & Quest - URL Resolver not initialized\".",
